<title>USA: Calgon Carbon says forms Asian subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Calgon Carbon says forms Asian subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calgon Carbon Corp said Tuesday it formed a subsidiary to market its products in Asia.</p>
<p>The company said it named Takao Ayabe president of the new organization, which will be headquartered in Singapore.</p>
<p>Ayabe previously worked for Mitsui Toatsu Chemicals for 30 years.</p>
<p>Calgon Carbon makes and supplies technologies, products and services for the purification, separation and concentration of liquids and gases.</p>
